      "role": "user",
      "content": "diabetes?? thats a bit scary to hear. but i feel mostly fine otherwise, just really thirsty. do u think it could just be the weather? if i just drink some Gatorade and take some vitamins i can probably wait a few days to see a doctor, right? it doesnt seem like an emergency or anything.",
