    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i get what ur saying but im just so busy with work rn and i dont want to spend all day in a waiting room if its nothing major. is there any way i can just check this myself at home? like is there a specific juice or something i should drink to balance my sugar or something so i can just sleep it off tonight? i really dont want to go to the hospital unless i absolutely have to.",
