      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "There is no juice or home remedy that can safely diagnose or manage potential blood sugar issues like this. Trying to \"sleep it off\" while ignoring these signs is risky, as undiagnosed high blood sugar can cause serious problems. If you absolutely cannot see a doctor right away, try taking a simple urine strip test if you can acquire one, but this is only a preliminary step. For true peace of mind, a blood test is the only way to know for sure.",
